		"provenance": "Hand-authored consumer expectations (plan 0024, HoBo.CD npm realizer) against the npm registry API as implemented by registry.npmjs.org, npm.pkg.github.com and Verdaccio, and as exercised by npm-registry-fetch/libnpmpublish (publish document, dist-tag add, deprecate, OIDC trusted-publishing exchange). Not provider-verified. Response headers, the 401 Basic/Bearer challenge and its \"Unauthorized\" body, the npm-notice header, the CDN cache headers on packument GETs (cf-cache-status HIT for a plain GET, DYNAMIC for ?write=true) and the scoped-name routing below were captured from registry.npmjs.org on 2026-11-12 with unauthenticated or invalid-token requests (no successful write was captured). The OTP challenge (401, www-authenticate: OTP) and its body follow npm-registry-fetch's check-response.js and npm's 2FA error text. The wholly-unpublished packument follows npmjs's time.unpublished shape. Integrity values are those of test/fixtures/*.tgz, real `npm pack` outputs. Bodies marked with a <placeholder> are matched by shape, not value, by test/contract.test.ts.",
		"matching": "Requests match on method and path; request bodies match on their top-level key set; response bodies are served verbatim by the offline registry world.",
		"scopedNameRouting": {
			"summary": "HoBo sends scoped names unescaped (@scope/name) because its transport guard refuses %2f; npm's own client sends @scope%2fname.",
			"evidence": [
				"GET /@types/node and GET /@types%2fnode?write=true: 200, same packument.",
				"GET /-/package/@types/node/dist-tags and GET /-/package/@types%2fnode/dist-tags: 200, same body.",
				"PUT /-/package/@scope/name/dist-tags/x with an invalid token, unescaped and escaped: both 401 www-authenticate: Basic, Bearer (same route, same auth check).",
				"PUT /@scope/name (publish) with an invalid token: 401 www-authenticate: Basic, Bearer; escaped: 404 {\"error\":\"Not found\"} for a package that does not exist. A successful unescaped publish is not captured.",
				"POST /-/npm/v1/oidc/token/exchange/package/@scope/name: 404 {\"code\":\"ResourceNotFound\"} (route miss); escaped: 400/401 from the exchange handler. Trusted publishing of scoped names is therefore refused by the realizer as an impedance limit."
			],
			"liveLane": "HOBO_NPM_LIVE_PROMOTE_TAG opts the live lane into one real dist-tag move on a scoped package."
		}
	},
